OL,3,GNEWSARail and road disruption planned
OL,4,Afor same weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FRailway passengers travelling through
OL,7,FGloucestershire are being urged to plan
OL,8,Fahead of rail improvement work which is
OL,9,Fdue to coincide with roadworks.
OL,11,FGreat Western Railway said it would run
OL,12,Freplacement road transport between
OL,13,FGloucester and Cheltenham Spa or
OL,14,FWorcester Foregate Street, plus to and
OL,15,Ffrom Birmingham New Street, on the
OL,16,Fweekends of 10/11 and 17/18 October.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
