OL,3,GNEWSARail and road disruption planned
OL,4,Afor same weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe work coincides with Cheltenham
OL,7,FLiterature festival, which is due to
OL,8,Ftake place between 9 and 18 October, a
OL,9,Fweekend closure of the M5 and A417 and
OL,10,Fthe start of work at Almondsbury
OL,11,FInterchange, just south of
OL,12,FGloucestershire, near Bristol.
OL,14,FGreat Western Railway said the work was
OL,15,Fimportant to maintain rail services for
OL,16,Fpassengers.
